# Versification "Bible Strong NFC": an overlay on Paratext org.vrs, for la Nouvelle Français courant (NFC).
#
# NFC numbers as org (LSG), as BFC does, but prints many rows that stand for several verses,
# stored on the first number; the numbers that follow have no row. Each mapping line sends such a
# row to every org verse it stands for. Where the row ends its chapter, the chapter ends there
# too. Verses the text leaves out (1 Samuel 13:1, Matthew 17:21…) keep their number.
#
# The lines were read from the published coverage (the verse numbers each chapter has) and
# checked against the texts (docs/research/versification.md, section 2.5).
#
GEN 20:17 36:40
NUM 4:34
2SA 17:28
2KI 12:21
1CH 6:62 25:9
2CH 35:26
PSA 2:11
ECC 8:16
DAN 10:20
JOL 4:20
ACT 19:41
1CO 5:12
